# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Only ONE variable is ever required, and even that is optional.
#
#   GEMINI_API_KEY
#
# With no key at all the engine runs deterministically against the
# bundled evidence corpus, so the app still builds, deploys and demos
# end to end. A key upgrades extraction, classification, critique,
# commerce copy and question answering to a live model.
#
# IMPORTANT when configuring a host such as Vercel: do not paste this
# whole file into the environment editor. Every commented line below
# would be created as a defined-but-empty variable, and an empty value
# is not the same as an absent one. Add only the keys you actually set.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------

GEMINI_API_KEY=

# ---- everything below has a working default; leave unset ----------

# Judgement calls: extraction, adversarial critique, commerce copy.
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.1-pro-preview

# High-volume cheap calls: classification and normalization.
# GEMINI_FAST_MODEL=gemini-3.7-flash

# Anthropic works too; whichever key is present wins, Gemini first.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5
# ANTHROPIC_FAST_MODEL=claude-haiku-4-5-20251001

# Force a provider when both keys are set: "gemini" or "anthropic".
# LLM_PROVIDER=

# Canonical origin for Open Graph URLs. On Vercel this is detected
# automatically from VERCEL_PROJECT_PRODUCTION_URL.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://your-domain.com
